  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "key": "skill.1425.description",
    "text": "消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">40</style>点<style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>，跃至空中向敌人奋力投掷出风之长矛。对范围内的所有敌人造成<style=\"physical\">物理伤害</style>并大量削弱韧性值，并获得1层<style=\"accent-gn\">锐利</style>。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：面对有韧性条的敌方单位时装配，也可在面对大量敌方单位时装配。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341141",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "key": "skill.1427.description",
    "text": "向后腾挪并掷出长枪对目标范围造成<style=\"anemo\">风元素伤害</style>，如果「战意」 大于3点，强化为<style=\"accent-gn\">风神·飞鸟投</style>。<br><style=\"accent-gn\">风神·飞鸟投</style><br>消耗所有「战意」后跃并奋力掷出长枪对目标范围造成<style=\"anemo\">风元素伤害</style>，且为自身添加「护盾」，消耗「战意」越多，护盾量提升越高<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">「纵使敌阵坚不可摧，胜利之风吹拂之境亦能摧枯拉朽！」</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">大神攻略：当生存比较安全时，建议「战意」超过三星再使用该技能可以使伤害最大化。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341143",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "key": "skill.1431.description",
    "text": "一跃而起对目标及其周围造成大额<style=\"physical\">物理伤害</style>。每消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>层<style=\"accent-gn\">锐利</style>，该技能获得<style=\"accent-gn\">5%</style>充能。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：锐利冲击伤害很高，尽可能的消耗锐利，在固定时间内最大化的打出锐利冲击。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
